      "location": "2.1",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "The step concludes, “By [L1], this updated matrix is exactly the start of the upper-triangular factor.” The cited theorem requires unpivoted elimination to reach an upper-triangular matrix “without encountering a zero pivot.” The example's displayed post-first-step matrix has its next pivot a_22=0, so that hypothesis fails and it does not produce the cited normalised LU upper factor.",
      "severity": "fatal",
      "observed_sha256": "79904a534c05245b1995f082c233a4a9f03e91a6b93b3b5e2e2cce7367eab20b"
    },
    {
